        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-09-16T13:39:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don't know the scenario well, but if Ambuscade overkill's someone and pushes them out &nbsp;of the path of the train, does that help?</p>",
